# auxiliary inputs
checkpoints
checkpoint*
!**/checkpoints.py

# Local toolchain bootstrap (apt debs extracted without sudo)
.local/

# Turn Battle — canonical campaign artifacts are tracked so that every number
# the thesis reports can be traced back to the run that produced it: per-seed
# tournament JSON, training CSVs, experiment configs, figures, the aggregate
# and the campaign log. The two bulky regenerable trees are not tracked: model
# checkpoints (covered by the checkpoint rules above) and the C++ AlphaZero
# working directory, ~170 MB together, both rebuilt by run_campaign.sh.
turn_battle_results/**/az_cpp_run/

# Scratch outputs from the single-run modes, which write into the results root
# instead of a seed directory.
turn_battle_results/eval_*.json
turn_battle_results/algorithm_comparison.json
turn_battle_results/algorithm_comparison.csv
turn_battle_results/experiment_config.json
turn_battle_results/tournament_results.json
turn_battle_results/training_*.csv
turn_battle_results/turn_battle_report.tex

